msgstr "ឯកសារនេះមានអត្ថបទពណ៌ស​លើផ្ទៃពណ៌ស។"

#: src/features/documents/import-file.ts
msgid "This file couldn't be read. Choose a PDF, Word, JSON or LinkedIn export (.zip)."
